  <!-- EN: luciferium rain -->
  <LuciferiumRain.label>luciferium rain</LuciferiumRain.label>
  <!-- EN: Small droplets of water-mixed glitterworld nannites from high above landscape are gradually falling down onto this entire region of the planet. Anyone not under a roof will be target hosts for the nannites. -->
  <LuciferiumRain.description>从高空飘落的水混合着“闪光世界”纳米机器人的细小水滴，正逐渐洒落在这颗行星的整个区域。任何未在屋檐下的人都会成为这些纳米机器人的宿主目标。</LuciferiumRain.description>
  <!-- EN: Most of the nannites have fallen. -->
  <LuciferiumRain.endMessage>大部分纳尼特已经倒下了。</LuciferiumRain.endMessage>
  <!-- EN: A ship transporting advanced glitterworld nannites was shot down by an unknown entity overhead, causing its cargo to fall to the planet.\n\nThe nannites will find and enter the body of person or creature not under a roof.\n\nIt will last for anywhere between a few hours to a couple days. -->
  <LuciferiumRain.letterText>一艘运载先进“闪光世界”纳米机器人的飞船被头顶上的未知实体击落，导致其货物坠落至行星表面。

这些纳米机器人会寻找并侵入未在室内的人或生物体内。

这一状态将持续数小时至数天不等。</LuciferiumRain.letterText>
